  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "h2": { "en": "Introduction" },
      "sub": { "en": "What this guide is about" },
      "body": [
        {
          "p": {
            "en": "Mods make FiveM look and play better — graphics packs, scripts, ReShade presets and more. This short guide shows exactly where to put them."
          }
        },
        {
          "note": {
            "kind": "default",
            "en": "<strong>FiveM Legacy only:</strong> the Enhanced build (July 2026 early access) can't run mods yet. Also, some servers ban client mods — check the server rules first."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step1",
      "h2": { "en": "Step 1 · Find FiveM.app" },
      "sub": { "en": "Everything goes inside this folder" },
      "body": [
        {
          "h3": { "en": "Know your install path" }
        },
        {
          "ul": {
            "en": [
              "Default: <code>%localappdata%\\FiveM\\FiveM.app</code>",
              "Custom installs: e.g. <code>D:\\FiveM_Legacy\\FiveM.app</code>"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "note": {
            "kind": "green",
            "en": "Every mod goes somewhere inside <code>FiveM.app</code> — never anywhere else."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step2",
      "h2": { "en": "Step 2 · Download" },
      "sub": { "en": "Get the mod ready" },
      "body": [
        {
          "h3": { "en": "Download and extract" }
        },
        {
          "ol": {
            "en": [
              "Get the mod from its official page (Patreon, GitHub, Discord, ...).",
              "Make sure it's for <strong>FiveM Legacy</strong> — some mods are single-player only.",
              "<strong>Extract the zip fully</strong> — never use files straight from the archive."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step3",
      "h2": { "en": "Step 3 · Install by Type" },
      "sub": { "en": "The most important part" },
      "body": [
        {
          "h3": { "en": "Put files in the right folder" }
        },
        {
          "table": {
            "en": {
              "head": ["What you have", "Put it here", "Notes"],
              "rows": [
                ["Mod data (textures, files)", "<code>FiveM.app\\data</code>", "Most graphics packs & mods — merge if asked"],
                ["<code>.asi</code> plugins", "<code>FiveM.app\\plugins</code>", "Restart FiveM after installing"],
                ["ReShade files (dxgi.dll, ReShade.ini, reshade-shaders, .addon)", "<code>FiveM.app\\plugins</code>", "FiveM only loads ReShade from plugins"],
                ["<code>.rpf</code> (models, maps)", "<code>GTA V</code> root\\mods (create it)", "Single-player only — multiplayer ignores them"],
                ["<code>caches</code> folder", "Delete if problems", "The game regenerates it"]
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "note": {
            "kind": "green",
            "en": "<strong>Rule of thumb:</strong> game data goes into <code>data</code>, everything else goes into <code>plugins</code>."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step4",
      "h2": { "en": "Step 4 · Enable & Fix" },
      "sub": { "en": "Get it working in-game" },
      "body": [
        {
          "h3": { "en": "Enable and troubleshoot" }
        },
        {
          "ol": {
            "en": [
              "<strong>Restart FiveM</strong> after installing anything.",
              "ReShade: press <strong>Home</strong> in-game to open the panel.",
              "Crash? Delete the <code>caches</code> folder in FiveM.app and relaunch.",
              "Kicked from a server? Some servers ban mods — remove them before joining."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "note": {
            "kind": "red",
            "en": "<strong>ReShade needs approval:</strong> if Home does nothing, press <strong>F8</strong> in-game, find the <code>[Addons] ReShade5=ID:...</code> line, copy it (<strong>with your own ID</strong>) to the very bottom of <code>%localappdata%\\FiveM\\FiveM.app\\CitizenFX.ini</code>, save and restart."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "faq",
      "h2": { "en": "FAQ" },
      "sub": { "en": "Quick answers" },
      "body": [
        {
          "faqs": {
            "en": [
              { "q": "Crash after installing a mod?", "a": "Delete the <code>caches</code> folder in FiveM.app, relaunch, then remove the mod and re-add it." },
              { "q": "Mod not working?", "a": "Wrong folder (see the table), not approved via F8 (ReShade), or the server blocks client mods." },
              { "q": "Does the Enhanced build work?", "a": "Not yet — stick to <strong>Legacy</strong>; Enhanced can't run mods." }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
